m text-emerald-700">check_circle</span>Select a saved guest or enter manual guest details.</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-emerald-700">check_circle</span>Check-out must be after check-in.</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-emerald-700">check_circle</span>The selected room will be marked reserved after saving.</li></ul></section></aside>
